Sistem Persamaan Linier (EN)
Given a system of two linear equations with two variables:
3.​ax + by = c
4.​px + qy = r
Your task is to determine whether the system has ONE SOLUTION (intersecting lines),
INFINITELY MANY SOLUTIONS (coincident lines), or NO SOLUTION (parallel lines). If it
has exactly one solution, print the values of x and y rounded to two decimal places.
